    @Test void testSomething() { ... }
}
```

## File 1: `AuthServiceTest.java`

Mock: `UserRepository`, `PasswordEncoder`, `PasswordPolicyService`, `SessionService`, `AuditService`, `AppProperties`.

Create a helper to build AppProperties with test values:
```java
private AppProperties buildProps() {
