- `loginLocksAfter5Failures` — set user's `failedLoginAttempts` to 4, mock password mismatch. Call login. Assert user status is LOCKED.
- `loginCaptchaRequiredAfter3Failures` — set user's `failedLoginAttempts` to 3, call login without captcha. Assert `BusinessException` thrown with message containing "Captcha".
- `registerSuccess` — mock no existing user, mock password validation returns empty list. Call register. Verify `userRepository.save` called.
