# Create EncryptionServiceTest

Create file `backend/src/test/java/com/shiftworks/jobops/service/EncryptionServiceTest.java`.

First read `backend/src/main/java/com/shiftworks/jobops/service/EncryptionService.java` to understand the class — it has `encrypt(String)` and `decrypt(String)` methods, plus an `init()` method called by `@PostConstruct`. It takes `AppProperties` as constructor arg.

