Fix prompt:

Open backend/src/main/java/com/shiftworks/jobops/service/AppealService.java.

In the listAppeals method, when the user is a REVIEWER and no status query param is provided, default to filtering by AppealStatus.PENDING. Find the section that builds the query for REVIEWER users and add:

if (user.role() == UserRole.REVIEWER && (statusValue == null || statusValue.isBlank())) {
    // Default to PENDING for reviewers per spec
    statusValue = "PENDING";
}

