## FIX 13 — AppealService: default to PENDING for reviewer list

Open `backend/src/main/java/com/shiftworks/jobops/service/AppealService.java`.

In the `listAppeals` method, when the user is a REVIEWER and no status filter is provided, default to PENDING. Add before the query:

